ut1-categories.tsv.gz

Contains data from UT1 (Université Toulouse Capitole), CC BY-SA 4.0.

The file is an adaptation of the UT1 blacklists by Fabrice Prigent and the Université
Toulouse Capitole, taken from the mirror @REPOSITORY@ at commit @COMMIT@. The categories
shopping, jobsearch and social_networks were mapped to the Holtmail topics purchases, jobs and
social; host names were normalised, and hosts that are IP addresses, shared platforms or
mailbox providers were removed.

